From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saturn <saturn@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 03:03:21 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] Saturn: sidebar polish - URL pill and popup, hover-only
 close, drag to favorites

13px Inter Medium everywhere; 5px between tabs; row hover white 5%;
close button (Figma glyph) only on hover, 5px from the right edge.
No space name; divider and Clear only while the cursor is over the
sidebar; the sidebar no longer drags the window. URL pill per Figma
4097:356 (domain only + copy button); clicking it, Ctrl+L, or New tab
opens a centered URL popup (Enter navigates, Esc cancels). Closing the
last tab keeps the window on a blank page. Dragging a tab over the
favorites shows an outlined slot and pins it; over the Pinned list it
moves the page into the list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
